            "text": "Business Logic - Discount Code Manipulation — Requires further review: /api/BasketItems/coupon - Coupon/Discount Bypass\n\nGET /api/BasketItems/coupon returns 404, POST returns 500. Coupon endpoint structure unclear. OWASP Juice Shop is known to have discount-related vulnerabilities, but could not validate without proper API understanding. Known OWASP Juice Shop coupon codes (OWASP2017, etc.) were not testable due to API format issues."
